{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55253","headline":"与监修国史赵莹诗 · 贾纬","name":"与监修国史赵莹诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满（《吟窗杂录》作「清」）朝唯我相，秉柄无亲雠。\n三年司大董，最切是编修。\n史才不易得，勤勤处处求。\n愚从年始立，东[观]（望）思优游。\n昔时人未许，今来虚白头。\n春台与秋阁，往往兴归愁。\n信运北阙下，不系如虚舟。\n绵蕝非所好，一日疑三秋。\n何当适所愿，便如适瀛洲。\n（见中华书局校点本《旧五代史》卷一三一《贾纬传》。\n《吟窗杂录》卷二十八录首四句。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾纬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}